WEBVTT

00:04:29.454 --> 00:04:33.663
So for a long time, archaeologists thought
that this was a foreign king.

00:04:33.704 --> 00:04:35.538
But his teeth told a different story.

00:04:35.579 --> 00:04:38.704
By sampling his first molar,
his wisdom tooth and bone,

00:04:38.746 --> 00:04:42.288
we found that he, in fact, probably came
from somewhere in the Maya region.

00:04:42.329 --> 00:04:45.371
So he was a migrant,
but he may have lived in multiple places

00:04:45.413 --> 00:04:47.121
before coming to live at Copán,

00:04:47.163 --> 00:04:50.579
even though he dressed
like he was a foreigner,

00:04:50.621 --> 00:04:52.288
someone from Mexico.

00:04:52.329 --> 00:04:55.704
And I always think about when
the Chicago Cubs were in the World Series

00:04:55.746 --> 00:04:57.746
and people went out and bought Cubs gear,

00:04:57.788 --> 00:05:00.038
even though maybe
they'd never been to Chicago.